t entry at the reused index does not authorize success for this operation.',source_ids=[api,err],scope=dict(description='Pending append notifications in a fixed valid cluster, including leadership changes, with no log compaction, no storage failures and unique payloads so operation content is observable.',assumptions=['Correct peer identities and unmodified messages produced by the implementation.','Configured runtime timers and caller-driven transport execute; network may temporarily isolate a peer.'],excluded=['No guarantee that a pending or superseded operation must succeed.','No claim of conflicting consensus decisions.','Crash recovery, compaction, batching and reconfiguration are outside the initial check.']),pending=[],grounding=dict(source_ids=[notify,assign,loop,'src-sync'],expectation_ids=[api,err],derivation='append_notify promises the entry\\\\'s decided index. Superseded documentation explicitly distinguishes an entry possibly surviving a new ballot from certainty of confirmation. This requires success to correspond to the submitted entry, not merely some entry occupying that numeric index.',applicability='Success-only safety of client completion, including permitted leader changes. Errors and pending responses do not violate this implication.',unresolved=['Execution must establish replacement and the timing of notification in the same legal history.']))\nbinding=dict(id='bind-notify',material_id=notify,symbol='drain_notifiers',start_line=201,end_line=222,description='Consumes assigned index and ballot; success match precedes ballot supersession.',pending=[],associations=[dict(claim_id='claim-notify-correspondence',source_ids=[notify,api,err],rationale='This handler resolves the original operation future and is therefore the consumer implementing the client success contract.')])\nchanges={}\nfor key in ['target_profile','core_overview','A6','A7','b-prepare']:\n changes[key]=dict(impact='clarification',source_ids=[load,init,api,loop,notify,st],rationale=